<title>USA: St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00</p>
<p>lower. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    59.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    58.50-59.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 0.50 lower. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs    48.50</p>
</text>
